# A seed of WidenFlowNodes with bit 30 set gives anything to every result of a call or a read: Link at its weakest. All 42 of this program are given more; seed 16 draws 10 of them.
# OPTIONS: testing=WidenFlowNodes:1073741824 check=FlowMonotonicity
# STATISTIC: FactNodesWidened = 42
# PROGRAM-OF: link-given-more-finds-no-less.ir
# RUN: link functions mechanisms=all
# CHECK: function f1 callers-known one-callee
# CHECK-NEXT: parameter 0 {{*}}proven=string
